 "note": "Turkey Hill Middle School, identified by its own heading on line 6 ('TURKEY HILL MIDDLE SCHOOL STAFF 1997 - 1998'). Lines 1-5 are the end of the principal's narrative (School Improvement Plan); line 49 is the page number. Two columns (x 0.05 / 0.58), each a run of section headings in capitals with 'Name, title-or-room' entries beneath; headings sharing a row with a name (lines 19, 30, 36, 39, 42, 45) are claimed by that row's entry. The title printed after a name (Principal, Asst. Principal, Nurse, Guidance, Music, PE, Tech Ed, Art, Health, World Lang.) goes in role_raw; room numbers ('Rm. 201', 'RM. 110', 'PRT1'/'PRT2' -- apparently portable classrooms) are not roles and are not recorded. Line 44 prints 'Danja Foss, World Lang. Rm. 202': role 'World Lang.', room dropped. Under RESOURCE CENTER the column runs on through line 33 with no further heading, so Barbara Brown to Mary Powers are recorded under it as printed."
